  "_note": "Random-init EXAONE Tabular fixture (BSD-3-Clause-LG architecture, our weights; the fixture weights are ours, so the commercial/redistributable flags describe THEM, not LG's released checkpoints). One safetensors per task. H is DYNAMIC; y carries train labels only (length = train_size). The model standardises its features itself and the wrapper standardises the regression target in-graph, so the engine profile is *_raw. Classification outputs class logits; regression outputs ONE raw-space point estimate (the mean of the quantile head). Rows < S are in-context fitted values (context rows presented a second time as queries)."
